users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-01T13:26:51Z","updated_at":"2025-10-01T13:26:51Z","body":"+1 to add.\n\nI was about to say that I would not use \"MIT\" in the name or ID. While it's thematically quite similar to [MIT](https://spdx.org/licenses/MIT.html), the actual text is not a particularly close match.\n\nBut, I see that it's quite close (while not actually being a match) to one that's called [`MIT-Modern-Variant`](https://spdx.org/licenses/MIT-Modern-Variant.html), I am guessing based on the old Fedora wiki MIT-style naming.\n\nBased on that, I'm fine with the ID and name that @xsuchy proposed above in the previous comment.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/3356320625/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/3386563745","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2839#issuecomment-3386563745","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2839","id":3386563745,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE87J2tyh","user":{"login":"JimVitrano","id":4322194,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzMjIxOTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4322194?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JimVitrano","html_url":"https://github.com/JimVitrano","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JimVitrano/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JimVitrano/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JimVitrano/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JimVitrano/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JimVitrano/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JimVitrano/